vbUdob2FZczFDTzdyRWJlNXJnd1dxQ1VXaDdWbHh3NEU0b0dwcFVDQjlaM2Uzc2lGRUUzOGpsUktQdFQyeHEwcDd6NXp1RXVWMEN3bDRURS1RNlB1VkZwSDM0R29KenhzckYxb2dXMmVCb19aeFp3aVlkeVJreHRtanFTLXZtbmY2Q2dvTWktaWhMSkdNb0ZzeXVjU0Z1elprQ0pnSUkybVJPVkNXVWM?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"Monster Beverage Corporation（NASDAQ：MNST）如何在 2026 年第三季淨銷售額成長 16.7%？"},{"title":"KFC pairs chicken tenders with Doritos on select menus as PepsiCo renews its drink deal in 8 countries.","src":"Stock Titan","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNMWdkU0gzZGtHMzFwQUxfZ1VrRjdfQXctbnlleE1JMkJGQ1lFeWZfVUZrOTVLbmhTYW5DVklLVEU3MUVJdWxKRXQzdDVsOFRPenRRWFByM211SWQ5TzhuRFlvdmJiRWc5WXZTUElWZzVRbzg0N0dGVTlzU3V6OW5peDZkUTlPTlRCaDBFZGxUWmZHSVIwT2Mzd0J4TFoyZHptSzJ4R09nZndHeWRpUGJj?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"隨著百事可樂在 8 個國家續簽飲料協議，肯德基在部分菜單上搭配炸雞塊和多力多滋 (Doritos)。"},{"title":"How Did DraftKings Inc. (NASDAQ:DKNG) Grow Third Quarter 2026 Revenue 16 Percent and What Guidance Follows?","src":"Kalkine","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"DraftKings Inc.（NASDAQ：DKNG）如何讓 2026 年第三季營收成長 16%？有何指導？"},{"title":"Monster Beverage Reports Strong Third-Quarter Sales and Earnings Growth","src":"TipRanks","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"Monster Beverage 報告第三季銷售和獲利成長強勁"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"能源/電力","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/865752/000110465926020831/mnst-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"When this report uses the words \"the Company\", \"we\", \"us\" and \"our\", these words refer to Monster Beverage Corporation and its subsidiaries, unless the context otherwise requires. Based in Corona, California, Monster Beverage Corporation is a holding company and conducts no operating business, except through its consolidated subsidiaries. The Company's subsidiaries primarily develop and market energy drinks.","zh":"當本報告使用「本公司」、「我們」、「我們」和「我們的」等詞語時，除非上下文另有要求，這些詞語均指 Monster Beverage Corporation 及其子公司。 Monster Beverage Corporation 總部位於加州科羅納，是一家控股公司，除透過其合併子公司外，不開展任何經營業務。該公司的子公司主要開發和銷售能量飲料。"},{"en":"We also develop, market, sell and distribute craft beers, flavored malt beverages (\"FMBs\") and hard seltzers under a number of brands, including Jai Alai IPA, Florida Man IPA, Dale's Pale Ale , Wild Basin Hard Seltzers, Dallas Blonde , Deep EllumTM IPA, Perrin Brewing Company Black Ale, Hop Rising Double IPA, Wasatch Apricot Hefeweizen, The BeastTM, Beast Tea, Blind Lemon , Blinder LemonTM and other brands.","zh":"我們也開發、行銷、銷售和分銷多個品牌的精釀啤酒、風味麥芽飲料（「FMB」）和硬蘇打水，包括 Jai Alai IPA、Florida Man IPA、Dale's Pale Ale 、Wild Basin Hard Seltzers、Dallas Blonde 、Deep EllumTM IPA、Perrin Brewing Company Blackpris、Wpria、Theprising、Theprising Ali Tea、Blind Lemon、Blinder LemonTM等品牌。"},{"en":"The \"alternative\" beverage category combines non-carbonated, ready-to-drink iced teas, lemonades, juice cocktails, single-serve juices and fruit beverages, ready-to-drink dairy and coffee drinks, energy drinks, sports drinks and single-serve still waters (flavored, unflavored and enhanced) with \"new age\" beverages, including sodas that are considered natural, sparkling juices and flavored sparkling beverages. According to Beverage Marketing Corporation, domestic U.S. wholesale sales in 2025 for the \"alternative\" beverage category of the market are estimated at approximately $76.8 billion, representing an increase of approximately 2.4% over estimated domestic U.S. wholesale sales in 2024 of approximately $75.0 billion.","zh":"「另類」飲料類別將非碳酸、即飲冰茶、檸檬水、果汁雞尾酒、單份果汁和水果飲料、即飲乳製品和咖啡飲料、能量飲料、運動飲料和單份靜水（調味、無味和增強）與「新時代」飲料（包括被認為是天然的蘇打水、起泡果汁和調味飲料）結合起來。根據 Beverage Marketing Corporation 的數據，2025 年美國國內市場「另類」飲料類別的批發銷售額預計約為 768 億美元，比 2024 年美國國內批發銷售額預計的約 750 億美元增長約 2.4%。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our sales and marketing strategy for all our non-alcohol beverages is to focus our efforts on developing brand awareness through image-enhancing programs and product sampling. We support our non-alcohol brands with prize promotions, price promotions, competitions, endorsements from selected public and sports figures, sports personality endorsements, influencer endorsements, collaborations, sampling and sponsorship of selected athletes, teams, series, bands, esports, causes and events. We utilize \"push-pull\" methods to enhance shelf and display space exposure in sales outlets (including racks, coolers and barrel coolers), advertising, in-store promotions and in-store placement of point-of-sale materials to encourage demand from consumers for our products. In-store posters, outdoor posters, social media, concerts, print, radio and television advertising (directly and through our sponsorshi","zh":"我們對所有非酒精飲料的銷售和行銷策略是專注於透過形象提升計畫和產品樣品來提高品牌知名度。我們透過有獎促銷、價格促銷、競賽、選定的公眾和體育人物的認可、體育名人認可、有影響力的認可、合作、採樣和贊助選定的運動員、團隊、系列賽、樂隊、電子競技、事業和活動來支持我們的非酒精品牌。我們利用「推拉」方法來增加銷售網點的貨架和展示空間（包括貨架、冷卻器和桶式冷卻器）、廣告、店內促銷以及銷售點材料的店內放置，以鼓勵消費者對我們的產品的需求。店內海報、戶外海報、社交媒體、音樂會、印刷品、廣播和電視廣告（直接或透過我們的贊助商）"},{"en":"We also manage taprooms and brewpubs adjacent to some of our manufacturing locations where we sell our alcohol products, merchandise, and food to consumers in a branded environment.","zh":"我們也在一些製造地點附近管理酒吧和啤酒吧，我們在品牌環境中向消費者銷售酒精產品、商品和食品。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The beverage industry is highly competitive. The principal areas of competition are pricing, packaging, development of new products and flavors as well as promotional and marketing strategies. Our products compete with a wide range of drinks produced by a relatively large number of companies.","zh":"飲料業競爭激烈。競爭的主要領域是定價、包裝、新產品和口味的開發以及促銷和行銷策略。我們的產品與相對較多的公司生產的各種飲料競爭。"},{"en":"Important factors affecting our ability to compete successfully include brand and product image, taste and flavor of products, trade and consumer promotions, rapid and effective development of new and unique cutting-edge products, ingredients, production processes, attractive and different packaging, brand exposure and marketing as well as pricing. We depend on our bottlers/distributors to prioritize our products, provide efficient, stable and reliable distribution and secure adequate shelf space in retail outlets. Competitive pressures in the \"alternative,\" energy, coffee, \"functional,\" \"craft beer\" and \"beyond beer\" (hard seltzers, FMBs, canned cocktails and other ready-to-drink beverages) beverage categories could cause our products to maintain or to lose market share, or we could experience price erosion, which could materially impact our business and results of operations.","zh":"影響我們成功競爭力的重要因素包括品牌和產品形象、產品口味和風味、貿易和消費者促銷、快速有效地開發新的和獨特的尖端產品、成分、生產工藝、有吸引力和不同的包裝、品牌曝光和營銷以及定價。我們依靠我們的裝瓶商/分銷商來優先考慮我們的產品，提供高效、穩定和可靠的分銷，並確保零售店有足夠的貨架空間。 「另類」、能量、咖啡、「功能性」、「精釀啤酒」和「超越啤酒」（硬蘇打水、FMB、罐裝雞尾酒和其他即飲飲料）飲料類別的競爭壓力可能會導致我們的產品維持或失去市場份額，或者我們可能會經歷價格侵蝕，這可能會對我們的業務和經營業績產生重大影響。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Monster Energy Drinks","val":7665871000,"zh":"Monster 能量飲料部門"},{"name":"Strategic Brands","val":468716000,"zh":"策略品牌區隔市場"},{"name":"Alcohol Brands","val":134720000,"zh":"酒類品牌細分市場"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":25036000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":8294343000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"U.s.& Canada","val":5072691000,"zh":"美國和加拿大"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1899568000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Latin America & Caribbean","val":697971000,"zh":"拉丁美洲和加勒比海地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":624113000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":8294343000}},"peers":["ROST","ORLY","ULTA","MDLZ","DLTR"]}}